        "approximated Hessian",
        "quasi-Newton approximation",
        "a approximate",
        "\\\\Delta\\{0\\}",
        "upper bounded",
        "lower bounded",
        "\\\\sqrt\\{G\\} C_2",
        "\\\\sqrt\\{G\\}C_2",
        "regularization-based",
        "regularization based",
        "(?<![\\\\_])gtol",
        "\\\\citet",
        "B_\\{\\\\mathrm\\{BFGS\\}\\}",
        "we denote",
        "B_0",
        "an noise tolerant",
        "\\\\emph\\{",
        "—",
        "\\\\texttt\\{\\(",
